  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the green peppers and cook until they start to soften.",
    "Add the ground ginger, ground cumin, salt, and black pepper, and stir well.",
    "Add the candy and stir well.",
    "Pour in the coconut cream and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let the tagine cook for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
